<title>SPAIN: Spain's Bankinter interim dividend rises 20.31 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Bankinter interim dividend rises 20.31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Bankinter said on Monday it would pay a third 1996 gross interim dividend of 154 pesetas per share, effective January 4.</p>
<p>Shareholders would receive a net dividend of 115.5 pesetas per share, the bank said.</p>
<p>&quot;This dividend represents a 20.31 percent increase compared with the third dividend paid against 1995, and is added to the 302 pesetas already paid against this year's results&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 595 2161</p>
